---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { levels } from '../../lib/curriculum';
---
<Base title="Japanese Learning Pathway — Foundations to N1" description="Begin Japanese at Level 0 Foundations, then follow the JLPT N5–N1 learning pathway at FreeJapaneseAcademy." breadcrumbs={[{label:'Courses',href:'/learn/'}]}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><span>Courses</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">EXPLORE YOUR PATH</span><h1>Every level starts<br/>with curiosity.</h1><p>Start from zero with Japanese Foundations, then explore five progressive JLPT pathways from N5 to N1. Browse the roadmap and begin with the published Foundations lessons.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE JLPT PATHWAY</span><h2>Find your starting point.</h2></div><p class="lead">New to Japanese? Begin with Level 0 Foundations before progressing to N5. Already studying? Explore the level that matches your experience.</p></div>
    <div class="foundation-feature"><span class="eyebrow">NEW TO JAPANESE?</span><div><h2>Start at Level 0.</h2><p>Before JLPT N5, learn how Japanese writing works. Our first six Foundations lessons are published and ready to study.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/learn/start/">Explore Japanese Foundations ↗</a></div>
    <div class="course-grid">{levels.map(level => <a href={`/learn/${level.id}/`} class={`course-card tone-${level.tone}`}><span class="course-num">{level.rank}</span><div class="course-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{level.label}</div><strong>{level.name}</strong><small>{level.stage}</small><div class="course-bottom"><span>View pathway</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a>)}</div>
    <div class="course-notice"><strong>Growing lesson by lesson:</strong> Japanese Foundations Lessons 01–06 are published. The remaining curriculum and full-length practice exams are still in development. A separate N5 demonstration lesson and quiz show the future learning experience.</div>
  </div></section>
</Base>
